#twoweapon beats the Tsurugi easily.

Grayswandir is the best weapon in the game, but Excalibur is perfectly
fine and I wouldn't waste time going for GS (especially with the
searching capabilities of Ex).

If you have the scrolls to burn, a silver saber in Gehennom and a
katana for the run is the best off-hand setup, but I usually just go
with the katana (keep a saber around for shades if you insist on
killing them; usually you can just run around them)--there's not
really a burning need to kill things all that quickly in Gehennom
compared to Astral/Valley, and it's not like Excalibur+katana won't
cut them down pretty darned fast anyway.


